# 0272 = 0271 + BUS_PERF_NOISE_STILL_TR (0x2420 bit21) cleared by default to
#   match the vendor oracle. The 0185 noise quirk stays behind ruby_noise=1.
#   Single variable; acceptance = idle IN read shows no XactErr.
